<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Free Trial</h1>
<p>Every new UTMPro workspace gets the <strong>Business plan completely FREE for 3 months</strong>. No credit card required.</p>

<h2>What's Included</h2>
<ul><li>10,000 links per month</li><li>250,000 events per month</li><li>10 custom domains</li><li>15 team members</li><li>A/B Testing</li><li>API Access</li><li>Geo & Device Targeting</li><li>Password Protection</li><li>Webhooks</li><li>Customer Insights</li></ul>

<h2>What Happens After 3 Months?</h2>
<p>When your trial expires, your workspace <strong>automatically switches to the Free plan</strong>. You won't lose any data — your links continue to work, but with Free plan limits (25 links/month, 1 domain, 1 member).</p>
<p>You can upgrade to a paid plan at any time from <strong>Settings → Billing → Upgrade</strong>.</p>

<h2>Trial Countdown</h2>
<p>You can see how many days remain in your trial on the <strong>Billing</strong> page. A green banner shows your remaining days.</p>
